# Environment variable names for anti-fraud-agent.
# Values never go in the repo: copy to .env and fill in locally.
# Each variable lands here with a comment when the code that reads it does
# (see .claude/skills/env-var/SKILL.md).

# --- Developer tooling (read by Claude Code, not by the agent) ---
# Must be exported in your shell: Claude Code expands it in .mcp.json and
# does not read .env.
# Fine-grained GitHub PAT for the GitHub MCP server, scoped to this repo only
# (Issues, Pull requests and Contents: read and write). Optional: without it
# the `github` MCP server fails to authenticate and skills fall back to `gh`.
GITHUB_MCP_PAT=
